From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] server: keep startup request trace through native WoW64 init

The current 3000-request diagnostic ends immediately before the request whose
reply was traced in ORBW00050. Extend the bounded trace so the next stalled
request is visible; this only changes diagnostic coverage.

---
diff --git a/server/request.c b/server/request.c
index 1b71aae2d5..1b71aae2d5 100644
--- a/server/request.c
+++ b/server/request.c
@@ -419,5 +419,5 @@ static void call_req_handler( struct thread *thread )
         extern int sceKernelDebugOutText( int channel, const char *text );
-        static int left = 3000;
+        static int left = 10000;
         if (left > 0)
         {
             char line[64];
-- 
2.43.0
